  "substitutions": [
    "Local wire checks replace authority with the TLS loopback peer; renderer Origin/Referer remain the original xpui origin.",
    "Authorization and client-token use explicit synthetic values from independent original producer fixtures. No individual credential hash is retained.",
    "Content-Length and body come from separately executed original Search/Home/album/artist producers; these captured H2 body bytes were not available.",
    "Producer-supplied locale and operation-specific app-version remain those original producer outputs; these H2 captures show locale en and full app version only."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The default capture proves two actual renderer POSTs on one H2 session, streams1 and3. The forced-H2 diagnostic proves12 additional POST field sequences; its selection is not a default.",
